  "body": "## What's Changed\n* Forget externally deleted machines in the API supervisor by @BinSquare in https://github.com/smol-machines/smolvm/pull/1241\n* Fix scoped memory, UID-isolated checkpoints, and VM restart safety by @BinSquare in https://github.com/smol-machines/smolvm/pull/1240\n* Add incremental live-checkpoint storage by @BinSquare in https://github.com/smol-machines/smolvm/pull/1232\n* Bump the workspace to 1.16.0 by @BinSquare in https://github.com/smol-machines/smolvm/pull/1242\n\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/smol-machines/smolvm/compare/v1.15.1...v1.16.0",
